  </data>
  <data name="Notice_WindowsKeyRejected" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>韌體拒絕了 Windows 鍵變更。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Notice_LcdOverdriveRejected" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>螢幕拒絕了 Overdrive 變更。</value>
    <comment>Overdrive = LCD overdrive, a screen setting that speeds up pixel response.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Notice_PowerPlan_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>電源計劃</value>
    <comment>Banner title: a Windows power plan.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Notice_PowerPlanFailed" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Windows 未切換到「{0}」。</value>
    <comment>{0} = a Windows power plan name. Use your language's quotation marks.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Notice_GpuMode_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>GPU 模式</value>
    <comment>Banner title.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Notice_GpuModeRejected" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>韌體拒絕了 GPU 模式變更。</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Notice_Autostart_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>隨 Windows 啟動</value>
    <comment>Banner title, same as Settings_StartWithWindows.Header.</comment>
  </data>
  <data name="Notice_AutostartFailed" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>無法更新啟動項目：{0}</value>
    <comment>{0} = a technical error message.</comment>
